<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool fy 1996 net sharply up vs '95.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool fy 1996 net sharply up vs '95.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool posted a net earning of C$28.2 million in fiscal 1996 (Aug/July), up 308 percent from the previous year's net earning of C$6.9 million, AWP first vice-president John Pearson told Manitoba Pool Elevators' delegates here on Thursday.</p>
<p>				1996			    1995</p>
<p> Net			$28,200		   $6,900</p>
<p> Revs		  $2,128,120	     $2,036,630</p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
